Claude API Integration (ai/prompts.py)
URL Classifier system prompt (returns JSON: {decision, confidence, reason, categories, age_rating}):

Classifies as allow/block/warn for a 10-year-old
Includes: domain, full URL if available, page title, last 3 session URLs for context
warn = borderline; parent notified but not blocked (used in moderate mode)

Daily Insight system prompt (returns JSON: {summary, screen_time_assessment, top_activities, concerns, positive_highlights, parent_action}):

Warm, non-judgmental tone; always starts with a positive if warranted
Input: screen time used vs. limit, browser history summary, blocked attempts, apps used

Weekly Insight system prompt (returns JSON: {weekly_summary, usage_trend, peak_usage_days, dominant_content_categories, concerns, improvements_noted, recommendations}):

Pattern analysis across 7 days; identifies trends not visible in daily view

Cost/rate management:

30-day cache in ai_decisions table — never re-classify same domain within TTL
Classification is async/batched at 00:30 nightly; real-time only for /api/classify-now
Daily insight: 1 call/day at 23:00 (~1,500 tokens)
Weekly insight: 1 call/Sunday at 23:30
max_daily_api_calls: 100 safety cap; tracked in job_runs table
After ~1 week cache warm-up, expect <20 new domain classifications/day


SQLite Schema (key tables)
sql-- All timestamps UTC. SQLite datetime('now') is UTC by default.

CREATE TABLE usage_sessions (
    id            INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    username      TEXT NOT NULL,
    date          TEXT NOT NULL,          -- ISO date "2026-03-09"
    start_time    TEXT NOT NULL,          -- ISO datetime UTC
    end_time      TEXT,                   -- NULL = session still open (or crashed)
    duration_secs INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    session_id    TEXT
);
CREATE INDEX idx_usage_sessions_user_date ON usage_sessions(username, date);

CREATE TABLE browser_visits (
    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    username    TEXT NOT NULL,
    url         TEXT NOT NULL,
    domain      TEXT NOT NULL,
    title       TEXT,
    visit_time  TEXT NOT NULL             -- UTC, from Firefox moz_historyvisits
);
CREATE INDEX idx_browser_visits_domain ON browser_visits(domain);
CREATE INDEX idx_browser_visits_user_time ON browser_visits(username, visit_time);

-- Tracks last-imported visit_time per user to avoid duplicate imports
CREATE TABLE browser_history_cursor (
    username        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    last_visit_time TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '1970-01-01T00:00:00'
);

CREATE TABLE ai_decisions (
    domain        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    decision      TEXT NOT NULL,          -- "allow" | "block" | "warn" | "pending"
    confidence    REAL,
    reason        TEXT,
    categories    TEXT,                   -- JSON array
    model_version TEXT,
    decided_at    TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (datetime('now')),
    expires_at    TEXT NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE job_runs (
    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    job_id      TEXT NOT NULL,
    started_at  TEXT NOT NULL,
    finished_at TEXT,
    success     INTEGER,                  -- 1/0/NULL
    error_msg   TEXT
);
CREATE INDEX idx_job_runs_job ON job_runs(job_id, started_at);

