## Flask Dashboard Routes

- `GET /` — today's screen time card, AI insight headline, blocked attempts count, scheduler health (from `job_runs`)
- `GET /reports` — Chart.js bar chart of daily usage, top domains table
- `GET/POST /filter` — AI decision table with override buttons, add/remove custom domains (CSRF-protected)
- `GET/POST /settings` — edit daily limits, bedtime, allowed hours per weekday (CSRF-protected); saves config + sends SIGUSR1
- `GET /insights` — rendered daily/weekly AI summaries with flagged concerns
- `POST /api/classify-now` — force immediate AI classification (AJAX, CSRF token in header)
- `GET /api/status` — JSON for dashboard auto-refresh every 30s (screen time, lock state, daemon uptime)
- `GET /api/health` — daemon health: last job run times, scheduler alive, DB reachable

