DecisionReasonDNS filtering over HTTP proxyTransparent, works for all apps, no SSL cert required; tradeoff: domain-level onlyAsync AI classification (nightly batch)Avoids DNS latency, reduces API cost; strict mode mitigates first-visit gapdnsmasq + iptables (not PAM time)PAM only restricts login, not active sessions; loginctl enforces mid-sessionCloudflare for Families upstream (1.1.1.3)Free first layer of adult/malware blocking as defense-in-depthRegenerate conf files atomicallyPrevents duplicate entries; safe for dnsmasq reads during reloadWAL mode for SQLiteDaemon writes + dashboard reads concurrently without blockingThread-local SQLite connectionsSimpler than a connection pool; avoids check_same_thread issues

